<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Sorcerer Spells</h1>
<p>The spells the Sorcerers' guild teaches, in its tower in Midgaard. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the spell there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>). Each spell has its own help: help and the spell's name.
</p>
<pre>Name                     Level   Up to
Burn                         0   100%
